\"code:ST 201\"  class=\"notoffered\">ST 201</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=ST%20243Z\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:ST 243Z\" >243Z</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=ST%20314\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:ST 314\" >314</a> or <a href=\"/search/?p=ST%20351\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:ST 351\" >351</a>).<br/>A minimum grade of C is required in <a href=\"/search/?p=FES%20241\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:FES 241\" >FES 241</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=FE%20208\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:FE 208\" >FE 208</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20241\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 241\" >MTH 241</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20245\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 245\"  class=\"notoffered\">MTH 245</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20251Z\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 251Z\" >MTH 251Z</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20251HZ\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 251HZ\" >MTH 251HZ</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20251\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 251\" >MTH 251</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=MTH%20251H\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:MTH 251H\"  class=\"notoffered\">MTH 251H</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=ST%20201\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:ST 201\"  class=\"notoffered\">ST 201</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=ST%20243Z\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:ST 243Z\" >ST 243Z</a>, <a href=\"/search/?p=ST%20314\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:ST 314\" >ST 314</a> and <a href=\"/search/?p=ST%20351\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:ST 351\" >ST 351</a>.</p><p class=\"maj\">Enrollment is limited to students with a program in:<ul><li>Forest Engineering (380)</li><li>Forest - Civil Engineering (381)</li><li>Natural Resources (671)</li><li>Forestry (706)</li><li>Forestry (820)</li></ul></p><p class=\"lvl\">INTO OSU GE/AE/Pathways or 